{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2025-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1739577600, "end_date": 1740182399, "month_true_total": 61, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:24:37 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "188444704", "author": {"steamid": "76561198030311754", "personaname": "BlacKat Anomaly", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198030311754/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 179, "playtime_forever": 1108, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 826, "last_played": 1753989925, "avatar": "bbe0980180eabdd4c3eb22ad536c733d8c8da876"}, "language": "english", "review": "🌟 \"A Thrilling Co-Op Xenomorph Hunt!\" 🌟\n\nIf you're a fan of Aliens and love intense co-op shooters, Aliens: Fireteam Elite is a must-play! Cold Iron Studios did an incredible job capturing the atmosphere of the Alien universe, delivering an action-packed, heart-pounding experience that never lets up.\n\n🔥 What makes it great?\n✅ Authentic Alien Vibes – From the eerie sound design to the relentless hordes of Xenomorphs, it feels like stepping into Aliens (1986).\n✅ Fun & Engaging Co-Op – Whether you're playing with friends or AI teammates, the teamwork-driven gameplay keeps every mission exciting.\n✅ Tons of Weapons & Classes – Plenty of customization options, allowing for different playstyles and strategies.\n✅ Challenging & Replayable – The higher difficulties are brutal, making coordination and skill essential for survival.\n\n🎮 If you love games like Left 4 Dead or Gears of War, this is right up your alley. With regular updates and expansions, there's always something new to experience. Grab your pulse rifle, squad up, and get ready to fight through waves of Xenos!\n\n⭐ 9/10 – A fantastic co-op shooter for Alien fans! 🐱‍👤💥", "timestamp_created": 1740175047, "timestamp_updated": 1740175047, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "188409762", "author": {"steamid": "76561198135991253", "personaname": "Bull Dog Hunter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198135991253/", "num_games_owned": 1500, "num_reviews": 436, "playtime_forever": 688, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 688, "last_played": 1737638034, "avatar": "8f57a7404a2830fd1f3197535ee38acb940a04b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game rules!!\nI went in expecting the game to be good, but I had know idea it would be this good.\nThe combat is great, the graphics are great, the customisation is great, the game is great.\nReally fun with friends, I played heaps of this with a mate and we had an awesome time for pretty much the whole thing.\nIf you like games that make you feel like a badass, this is definitely one you will want to check out.", "timestamp_created": 1740145769, "timestamp_updated": 1740145769, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.566203534603118896", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188388209", "author": {"steamid": "76561199002501176", "personaname": "ConcaveBucket", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199002501176/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 358, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 272, "last_played": 1778330020, "avatar": "0244904b8ec48f9e0355506d7bd5cd953385f20d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Jus